  "description": "The EF Core store of Elarion's published DAV collections (ADR-0111): the elarion_dav_collections, elarion_dav_objects and elarion_dav_changes tables on the PostgreSQL the application already runs, mapped onto its own DbContext through [GenerateElarionDavStore] or modelBuilder.UseElarionDavStore(). Publishing joins the context's transaction, so a published calendar object is visible exactly when the handler commits; one counter per collection under its row lock gives sync tokens that hold on every node, and the change journal prunes itself while a collection changes.",
